sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Website
    participant PaymentGateway as Payment Gateway
    participant Warehouse

    Customer->>Website: Browse and select items
    Website->>Website: Add items to cart
    Customer->>Website: Proceed to checkout
    Website->>Customer: Display order summary
    Customer->>Website: Enter shipping & payment info
    Website->>PaymentGateway: Submit payment request
    PaymentGateway->>PaymentGateway: Process payment
    PaymentGateway->>Website: Payment confirmed
    Website->>Website: Create order record
    Website->>Warehouse: Send order details
    Warehouse->>Warehouse: Pick and pack items
    Warehouse->>Website: Order ready for shipment
    Website->>Customer: Order confirmation email
    Customer->>Customer: Order placed successfully